#: ../../configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../configuration.md:3
msgid "minacode reads a single TOML file, `~/.minacode/config.toml` by default. Generate a commented starter with `minacode --init-config`, or point at another file with `--config <path>`."
msgstr "minacode 默认读取 `~/.minacode/config.toml`。使用 `minacode --init-config` 生成带注释的初始配置，或通过 `--config <path>` 指定其他文件。"

#: ../../configuration.md:7
msgid "<span class=\"marker\">Only the `[provider]` block is required.</span> Every other key falls back to a built-in default, so a minimal config is just a provider. Inspect the resolved configuration at any time with `/config`."
msgstr "<span class=\"marker\">只有 `[provider]` 是必需的。</span>其他配置项都会使用内置默认值，因此最小配置只需一个 provider。随时可以用 `/config` 查看解析后的完整配置。"

#: ../../configuration.md:11
msgid "Providers"
msgstr "Provider"

#: ../../configuration.md:13
msgid "minacode supports OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions and Responses APIs, plus the Anthropic Messages API. Define one or more `[provider.<name>]` blocks and select one with `[provider] active`:"
msgstr "minacode 支持 OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions、Responses API，以及 Anthropic Messages API。定义一个或多个 `[provider.<name>]`，再通过 `[provider] active` 选择当前 provider："

#: ../../configuration.md:27
msgid "These three fields are enough for most endpoints. minacode selects the usual protocol and applies only necessary, documented compatibility adjustments. Explicit settings always take precedence. Use `/config` to inspect the result."
msgstr "对大多数 endpoint，只需这三个字段。minacode 会选择常用协议，并且只应用必要且有文档依据的兼容调整。显式设置始终优先。使用 `/config` 查看最终结果。"

#: ../../configuration.md:31
msgid "Define additional blocks to use more providers. Switch between them with `/provider [NAME]`, and switch the active model with `/model [MODEL]`."
msgstr "可以添加更多配置块来使用多个 provider。通过 `/provider [NAME]` 切换 provider，通过 `/model [MODEL]` 切换当前模型。"

#: ../../configuration.md:34
msgid "API protocol"
msgstr "API 协议"

#: ../../configuration.md:36
msgid "Leave `api = \"auto\"` unless your endpoint needs an explicit protocol:"
msgstr "除非 endpoint 要求显式指定协议，否则请保留 `api = \"auto\"`："

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`auto`"
msgstr "`auto`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Infer the protocol when possible; otherwise use Chat Completions"
msgstr "尽可能推断协议，否则使用 Chat Completions"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`chat`"
msgstr "`chat`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions"
msgstr "OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`responses`"
msgstr "`responses`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "OpenAI-compatible Responses"
msgstr "OpenAI-compatible Responses"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`anthropic`"
msgstr "`anthropic`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Anthropic-compatible Messages"
msgstr "Anthropic-compatible Messages"

#: ../../configuration.md:45
msgid "A URL ending in `/chat/completions`, `/responses`, or `/messages` also selects that protocol."
msgstr "URL 以 `/chat/completions`、`/responses` 或 `/messages` 结尾时，也会选择对应协议。"

#: ../../configuration.md:47
msgid "Optional provider settings"
msgstr "可选 provider 设置"

#: ../../configuration.md:49
msgid "Most users can leave these unset."
msgstr "大多数用户无需设置以下选项。"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "配置项"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`api`"
msgstr "`api`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "API protocol shown above"
msgstr "上面列出的 API 协议"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`reasoning`"
msgstr "`reasoning`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`medium`"
msgstr "`medium`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Reasoning effort; change it during a session with `/reason`"
msgstr "Reasoning effort；在 session 中通过 `/reason` 修改"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`available_models`"
msgstr "`available_models`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "—"
msgstr "—"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Additional models shown by `/model`"
msgstr "`/model` 额外显示的模型"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`temperature`"
msgstr "`temperature`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Sampling temperature; omitted by default"
msgstr "采样温度；默认不发送"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_tokens`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Output-token cap and reserved compaction space"
msgstr "输出 token 上限及 compaction 预留空间"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`timeout`"
msgstr "`timeout`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`120`"
msgstr "`120`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Request timeout in seconds"
msgstr "请求超时秒数"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`prompt_cache_key`"
msgstr "`prompt_cache_key`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Stable prompt-cache key; set `off` to omit it"
msgstr "稳定的 prompt-cache key；设置为 `off` 时不发送"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`strict_tools`"
msgstr "`strict_tools`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`false`"
msgstr "`false`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Request strict function schemas where supported; toggle with `/strict`"
msgstr "在支持时请求 strict function schema；通过 `/strict` 切换"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`extra_body`"
msgstr "`extra_body`"

#: ../../configuration.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`{}`"
msgstr "`{}`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Extra fields for an OpenAI-compatible request body"
msgstr "添加到 OpenAI-compatible request body 的额外字段"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`chat_reasoning`"
msgstr "`chat_reasoning`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Provider-specific Chat reasoning format; normally leave on `auto`"
msgstr "Provider 特有的 Chat reasoning 格式；通常保留为 `auto`"

#: ../../configuration.md:64
msgid "Unknown OpenAI-compatible endpoints stay on the generic path. If automatic protocol selection is wrong for an endpoint, set `api` explicitly. `/status` shows the active model and cache usage reported by the provider."
msgstr "未知的 OpenAI-compatible endpoint 会使用通用路径。如果自动选择的协议不正确，请显式设置 `api`。`/status` 会显示当前模型以及 provider 报告的缓存用量。"

#: ../../configuration.md:68
msgid "Runtime"
msgstr "Runtime"

#: ../../configuration.md:70
msgid "Optional; the defaults shown are used when omitted."
msgstr "以下设置均可省略，表中列出其默认值。"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`yolo`"
msgstr "`yolo`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Start without confirmation prompts"
msgstr "启动时关闭确认提示"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_context_tokens`"
msgstr "`max_context_tokens`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`245760` (240K)"
msgstr "`245760`（240K）"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Total context ceiling used to calculate the automatic-compaction budget"
msgstr "用于计算自动 compaction 预算的 context 总上限"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_agent_steps`"
msgstr "`max_agent_steps`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`200`"
msgstr "`200`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Maximum tool steps in one turn"
msgstr "单轮任务的最大工具步数"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`shell_timeout`"
msgstr "`shell_timeout`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`60`"
msgstr "`60`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Maximum shell-command lifetime, in seconds"
msgstr "shell 命令最大运行秒数"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`bash_wait_timeout`"
msgstr "`bash_wait_timeout`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`10`"
msgstr "`10`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Foreground wait before a running command becomes a background job; `0` disables promotion"
msgstr "前台命令转为后台任务前的等待秒数；`0` 表示禁用"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`max_parallel_tools`"
msgstr "`max_parallel_tools`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Maximum read-only tool calls executed concurrently; `1` disables parallelism"
msgstr "并发执行只读工具的上限；`1` 表示禁用并发"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`session_retention_days`"
msgstr "`session_retention_days`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`7`"
msgstr "`7`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Delete inactive saved sessions older than this at startup; `0` keeps them indefinitely"
msgstr "启动时删除超过该天数未使用的 session；`0` 表示永久保留"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "`theme`"
msgstr "`theme`"

#: ../../configuration.md
msgid "Terminal theme: `auto`, `light`, or `dark`; overridden by `--theme`"
msgstr "终端主题：`auto`、`light` 或 `dark`；`--theme` 可覆盖"

#: ../../configuration.md:83
msgid "Selected tuning values can be changed for the current session with `/set` (Tab completion lists the supported keys). `/yolo` toggles `yolo`."
msgstr "部分配置可以用 `/set` 在当前 session 中修改，按 Tab 可补全支持的 key。`/yolo` 用于切换 `yolo`。"

#: ../../configuration.md:86
msgid "Data location"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: ../../configuration.md:93
msgid "Sessions live under `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`, one directory per working directory. Each holds that project's session logs and a `latest` pointer, so a resume stays scoped to the project it belongs to. A project directory is removed once its last session expires."
msgstr "Session 保存在 `<data_dir>/projects/<project>/`，每个工作目录对应一个子目录，其中存放该项目的 session 日志和 `latest` 指针，因此恢复操作始终限定在所属项目内。当某个项目的最后一个 session 过期后，对应目录会被一并删除。"

